The invention discloses a wireless intelligent charging system for a humanoid robot and aims at providing the wireless intelligent charging system for the humanoid robot. The wireless intelligent charging system comprises a circuit-integrated control module,  a core control judgment algorithm,  battery detection algorithm control,  a transmitting module and a receiving module. Proximity charging is carried out through an electromagnetic induction technology,  so that the charging efficiency is extremely high,  automatic identification and automatic charging judgment of the humanoid robot are achieved and the intelligence of the humanoid robot is achieved. 1. A robot-like wireless intelligent charging system,  comprising :  the charging system comprises a circuit integrated control module,  a core control judgment algorithm,  a battery detection algorithm control module,  a detection sensor,  a wireless communication module,  a transmitting module and a receiving module,  and is close to charging through an electromagnetic induction technology,  so that the charging efficiency is extremely high; 
      the circuit integrated control module comprises a singlechip,  a gate circuit,  a processor,  a memory,  a logic device and an analog module; 
      the core control judgment algorithm is used for calculating the distance between the robot and the self-charging when a certain amount of battery remains,  calculating the power consumption of the path and reminding the robot to return to the charging when the return time is reached; 
      the detection sensor judges a charging position area,  and the feedback system finds a charging induction area; 
      the battery detection algorithm is used for controlling,  the load is calculated according to the walking distance of the robot-like body,  and the required electric quantity is recorded; 
      the wireless communication module is used for positioning and detecting the robot and judging the residual electric quantity returned by the battery; 
      the electromagnetic induction charging is characterized in that a transmitting module and a receiving module are used for completing a charging process.

