      The sensor module,  a lighting state expression module,  a reduction motor module,  the camera vision module,  and a speaker module electrically connected to the microphone acoustic module central processing and control module;  module through a reduction motor driving module drives the mechanical module movement;  mechanical module is a servo-steering gear; 
