The invention discloses an external wrapping material of a bodybuilding reverse-Y-shaped trainer,  and relates to the technical field of bodybuilding devices. The external wrapping material is prepared from,  by weight,  100-120 parts of silicone rubber,  40-50 parts of butadiene styrene rubber,  20-25 parts of ethylene-vinyl acetate copolymer,  15-20 parts of coal ash,  15-20 parts of straw powder,  13-16 parts of hemp stalk powder,  10-15 parts of silica powder,  10-15 parts of rice bran wax,  10-15 parts of paroline,  8-13 parts of nanometer rubber powder,  7-12 parts of palm oil,  6-10 parts of tributyl citrate,  5-8 parts of bis-(gamma-triethoxysilylpropyl)-tetrasulfide,  3-6 parts of triallyl isocyanurate,  3-6 parts of azodicarbonamide and 2-4 parts of zinc stearate. The wrapping material has excellent strike resistance and weather resistance,  is long in service life and moderate in elasticity,  and has a fine and smooth surface and good stroke hand feeling;  the inner structure is dense,  oxygen can be effectively prevented from entering the trainer,  and the aim of protecting inner filling material is achieved;  safety and environment protection are achieved,  toxic substances can not be released in the use process,  and no harms are caused to human bodies. 1. An exercise trainer outer wrap material used humanoid,  characterized in,  made by the following parts by weight of raw material : 
      Silicone rubber 100-120 parts,  styrene-butadiene rubber 40-50 parts,  ethylene-vinyl acetate copolymer 20-25 parts,  fly ash 15-20 parts,  straw powder 15-20 parts,  ash magan 13-16 parts,  silica powder 10-15 parts,  rice bran wax 10-15 parts,  paraffin oil 10-15 parts,  nano-powder 8-13 parts,  palm oil 7-12 parts,  tributyl citrate 6-10 parts,  double-( γ-triethoxysilylpropyl) tetrasulfane 5-8 parts,  triallyl isocyanurate 3-6 parts,  azodicarbonamide 3-6 parts,  zinc stearate 2-4 parts; 
      A preparation method comprising the steps of : 
      To the (1) silicone rubber was charged with ethylene-vinyl acetate copolymer and a paraffin oil,  mixed with the mixture to stand for 15 min,  then at 40kHz ultrasonic frequencies,  power 100W 30min under sonication,  followed by addition of styrene-butadiene rubber and palm oil,  evenly mixing and then microwave frequency 2450MHz,  800W 15min microwaved under power,  the process ends after natural cooling to room temperature,  i.e. resulting material I; 
      The fly ash (2),  and a straw powder magan ash heat to 60-70 °C 10min incubation mixture,  followed by the addition of silica fine powder,  rice bran wax and nano-powder,  mixing continued incubation 15min,  i.e. resulting material II; 
      The material (3) while still hot in the I II materials were added,  followed by tributyl citrate,  bis-( γ-triethoxysilylpropyl) tetrasulfane,  triallyl isocyanurate,  azodicarbonamide and zinc stearate,  mixed thoroughly,  to give a premix; 
      Of the (4) premix was added a kneader,  kneading degree of plasticity is subjected to up to 0.5-0.8,  to give a green compound; 
      The kneaded (5) rubber in thin mill pass 3-5 times,  and then supplied to the flat foamed hot pressing in a vulcanizer,  a vulcanization temperature control 1st time 170-180 °C,  cure Time 12min,  2nd primary vulcanization temperature 190-200 °C,  cure Time 6min,  vulcanized article trimmed to give a finished product.

The invention discloses a cleaning agent for an indoor human-shaped training device for body building,  and relates to the technical field of bodybuilding equipment. The cleaning agent is prepared from,  by weight,  20-25 parts of coco coir,  12-17 parts of zeolite powder,  10-15 parts of glucoside,  10-15 parts of palm oil,  8-12 parts of nonylphenol polyoxyethylene ether,  6-10 parts of sugarcane wax,  6-10 parts of methylsilicone oil,  5-8 parts of lauryl polyoxyethylene ester,  4-6 parts of rapeseed powder,  4-6 parts of antibacterial agent,  3-4 parts of dipropylene glycol methyl ether,  2-3 parts of soda ash,  2-3 parts of citric acid,  1-2 parts of sodium chloride and 60-80 parts of ethyl alcohol. The cleaning agent has an excellent cleaning effect,  can effectively remove dust and sweat stains attached to the surface of the human-shaped training device and can achieve the function of maintenance. The cleaning agent is convenient to use,  and the training device can be wiped simply by placing a towel in the cleaning agent to be soaked without being scrubbed with water any more. By means of the antibacterial agent,  bacteria on the training device can be effectively killed,  a lasting antibacterial effect is achieved,  and safety and sanitation are achieved. 1. An exercise trainer cleaner humanoid used indoor,  characterized in,  made by the following parts by weight of raw material : 
      Coco peat 20-25 parts,  zeolite powder 12-17 parts,  glucoside 10-15 parts,  palm oil 10-15 parts,  nonylphenol ethoxylate 8-12 parts,  Saccharum officinarum 6-10 parts,  methyl silicone oil 6-10 parts,  lauryl alcohol polyoxyethylene aliphatic 5-8 parts,  rapeseed meal 4-6 parts,  an antimicrobial agent 4-6 parts,  dipropylene glycol monomethyl ether 3-4 parts,  soda ash 2-3 parts,  citric acid 2-3 parts,  sodium chloride 1-2 parts,  ethanol 60-80 parts; 
      Its production method are as follows : 
      Firstly the (1) coco peat,  zeolite powder was added to ethanol and rapeseed meal,  then at ultrasonic frequency 40 kHz immersed 1h,  100W 30min power under sonication,  followed by a ball mill,  milling 3-5h after filtration,  the filtrate thus obtained is the material I; 
      Saccharum officinarum and methyl silicone oil was added to the (2) palm oil,  heated to 80-85 °C 15min incubation mixture,  followed by addition of dipropylene glycol monomethyl ether,  soda ash and sodium chloride,  mixed with the mixture were further incubated 5min,  after the mixture was cooled to room temperature to give the material II; 
      I was added to the batch (3) material II,  glucoside,  polyoxyethylene nonylphenyl ether,  polyoxyethylene aliphatic lauryl alcohol,  antibacterial and citric acid,  may be mixed thoroughly.

