The embodiment of the invention discloses a control method of a waist transmission mechanism. The control method is used for solving the problem that a conventional double-motor transmission control structure cannot guarantee the coordination of two legs and is unstable in action. The control method of the waist transmission mechanism disclosed by the embodiment of the invention comprises the following steps :  a control system controls the operations of an output motor according to a preset program,  wherein the operations comprise opening or closing the output motor,  acceleration or deceleration,  and forward output or reverse output;  the control system obtains detection data of a first gear output end or a second gear output end,  detected by a rotation induction device;  the control system dynamically regulates the current output power of the output motor according to the detected data. 1. One lumbar actuator control method,  applicable to a drive mechanism for the waist of a humanoid robot,  waist driving structure comprises :  an output of the motor,  the dual transmission gear set,  1st 2nd gear output and the output gear;  1st sequentially through two transmission gear set driven while the output of the motor and the 2nd gear output gear output end;  1st left legs of a humanoid robot with an output gear,  2nd gear and the output of a humanoid robot right leg connection;  1st 2nd output terminal and the output gear wheel gear preset angle in the direction of the output gears;  control system is connected to the output motor;  1st 2nd output terminal and the output gear is mounted on toothed wheels rotating induction device; 
