The utility model discloses a walking stick with an imitated human head portrait. The walking stick with the imitated human head portrait comprises a walking stick head,  a walking stick body,  a nut and a connecting bolt,  wherein the upper part of the walking stick head adopts a hollow imitated human head,  the lower part of the walking stick head adopts a cylinder-shaped walking stick head neck part,  the imitated human head and the walking stick head neck part are integrally formed,  the nut is arranged in the inner cavity of the walking stick head neck part through pouring by using a pouring technology,  a threaded blind hole is formed in the top of the walking stick body,  the upper part of the connecting bolt is connected with the nut in a screwing manner,  and the lower part of the connecting bolt is connected with the threaded blind hole in a screwing manner. According to the walking stick provided by the utility model,  the nut is poured onto the walking stick head neck part by adopting the pouring technology,  moreover,  the connecting bolt is used for connecting the walking stick head with the walking stick body in a screwing manner,  therefore,  the effect that the walking stick head can be detached from the walking stick body can be achieved. A walking stick holder can replace the walking stick head at random,  so that the walking stick have kaleidoscopic external appearance characteristics. Moreover,  the hollow design of the hollow imitated human head also facilitates article storage of the walking stick holder. 1. A simulated humanoid headshot with a cane,  walking stick comprising a head and a rod body,  characterized in,  the wand further includes a nut and the connecting bolt; 
      A pole head is a hollow upper head hominus simulation,  the lower pole is cylindrical head and neck,  the head and neck of the hand wand head integrally molded hominus simulation; 
      Placing the neck is to be poured pole of lock nuts by inner processes; 
      The top of the rod body to form one threaded blind bore; 
      An upper portion of the connecting bolt and engages a nut,  threaded blind hole of the rod body and the lower portion of the connecting bolt is screwed.

A vehicle assistance method includes obtaining an acceleration of a vehicle detected by an acceleration detection unit;  determining whether or not the vehicle is moving according to the obtained acceleration of the vehicle;  obtaining an image of a box seat of the vehicle captured by a camera,  the image including a distance information indicating the distance between the camera and the objects captured by the camera;  creating a 3D model corresponding to the obtained image;  determining whether or not one or more people appear in the box seat according to the created 3D model;  controlling a driving unit to drive a pushing unit to push a brake when nobody appears in the box seat,  causing the vehicle to stop moving. A vehicle assistance system,  which includes : 
An acceleration acquisition module for acquiring acceleration detected by an acceleration sensor; 
A judgment module for determining whether the vehicle is moving according to the acquired acceleration; 
An image acquisition module for acquiring an image of the driver's seat position of a vehicle taken by a camera device when the vehicle is moving,  the image including distance information between each point of the article and the camera device; 
A three-dimensional building module,  which is used to build the acquired image into a corresponding three-dimensional model according to the distance from each point in the acquired several images to the camera device; 
An image analysis module for determining whether someone is in the driver's seat of the vehicle based on the established three-dimensional model;  and
An execution module is used to control a driving device to drive a brake unit to push up a hand brake unit when no one is in the driver's seat position,  so that the vehicle stops moving.

